    "description": "Please note: interior photos/video tour and showing schedule are posted on www.rentalsinsf.com.Available now!This is a stylish corner unit with a gated parking spot, high end appliances, built-in shelving and surround speakers. Newly updated throughout. Bamboo floors. Please note: small bedroom that will accommodate a Queen bed (full sized bed would be best). Beautiful 3/4 bathroom (shower only) with radiant heating in the floor. Great open kitchen with gas cook top, dishwasher, fridge. Large living room that gets great natural light.Small outdoor space adjacent to the gated parking spot.Building has shared laundry and a small amount of storage in the garage. Also, room to store a bicycle in the garage.Easy access to public transportation (F-Line, MUNI and #37 Bus among others)."
